Fitness Activity Recognition is an AI/ML-based system that identifies a person's physical activity using sensor data.

The system takes features such as:

Accelerometer X, Y, Z
Gyroscope X, Y, Z
Heart rate
Step count
Movement intensity

and predicts the activity being performed.

Example
Sensor Data
     ↓
Data Preprocessing
     ↓
Feature Scaling
     ↓
Machine Learning Model
     ↓
Activity Prediction
     ↓
Walking / Running / Cycling / Swimming / Standing